# This repo is the script package, never the material it operates on.

# Audio, anywhere. The reference rehearsal WAV alone is 2 GB.
# Both cases are listed: the H1essential writes .WAV in capitals, and git
# matches case-sensitively on Linux even though macOS does not.
*.wav
*.WAV
*.aif
*.AIF
*.aiff
*.AIFF
*.flac
*.FLAC
*.mp3
*.MP3
*.m4a
*.M4A
*.ogg
*.opus
*.aac
*.wv
*.caf
*.w64
*.rf64

# Peak caches — 74 MB for the reference recording
*.reapeaks
*.reapindex

# Recorder and render output directories
Media/
render/

# REAPER working files -- this repo is the package, not the user's project
*.RPP
*.RPP-bak
*-props.RPP
*.rpp-bak
.DS_Store

# Tool and build artifacts
luac.out
graphify-out/

# Claude Code session transcripts (dated, and large)
20??-??-??-*.txt
